<title>UK: BZW sets call and put warrants on the SMI index.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call and put warrants on the SMI index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 2.4 million American-style call and put warrants, in 24 equal tranches, on the SMI index, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one index.</p>
<p>There are 12 tranches of call warrants, of which 6 tranches mature on June 30, 1997 and the rest on December 31, 1997. There are also 12 tranches of put warrants, six tranches maturing June 30, 1997 and six tranches on December 31, 1997.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>PAYDATE  25.NOV.96  LISTING SWITZERLAND  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
